<h3><u>beemaar hai tu sughra</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>haaye sughra haaye haaye sughra<br>haaye sughra haaye haaye sughra<br><br>yasrab se shahe deen jo suwe karbala chale<br>ba hasrat o masaayeb o aah o buka chale<br>israar tha ye fatema sughra ka shah se<br>baba khudaara saath mujhe le ke jaayiye<br>sun kar fughaan ye fatema sughra se bole shah<br><br>beemaar hai tu sughra batlaade mujhe itna<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>aasaan nahin beta raahon ki jafa sehna<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>har gaam musibat hai raahon me aziyat hai<br>tu chal nahin paayegi kaanton pe musaafat hai<br>tu ghar ka ujaala ay sughra<br>tu surate zahra ay sughra<br>kar sabr ka yaara ay sughra<br>kar zabt khudara ay sughra<br>tu seh nahin paayegi hai sakht safar beta<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>ham ko hai jahaan rukna pur hol hai wo sehra<br>kehte hain jise karbal ham ko hai wahaan lutna<br>har samt qaza hai ay sughra<br>na aab o ghaza hai ay sughra<br>karbal wo jaga hai ay sughra<br>bas zulm o jafa hai ay sughra<br>is gham se to behtar hai tu ghar me rahe tanha<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>le god me asghar ko is nanne musaafir ko<br>jee bhar ke tu ay sughra tu dekhle akbar ko<br>ek mera gule tar ay sughra<br>ek shakle payambar ay sughra<br>de rukhsat mil kar ay sughra<br>taiyyaar hai dilbar ay sughra<br>ye qaaflah jaata hai ab jaanibe karbobala<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>soyi ek din sughra aur khwab me ye dekha<br>lutta hai bhara kunba shabbir huwe tanha<br>kehte the tarap kar ay sughra<br>meri pyari dukhtar ay sughra<br>tu dekh ye manzar ay sughra<br>koyi nahin yaawar ay sughra<br>ab jaan liya tu ne main is liye kehta tha<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>ghabra ke uthi muztar naani se kaha rokar<br>dekha hai abhi maine kehte the yehi sarwar<br>ab mere gale par ay sughra<br>chalne ko hai khanjar ay sughra<br>koyi nahin yaawar ay sughra<br>maare gaye dilbar ay sughra<br>ye soch ke hi maine bola tha tujhe beta<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise<br><br>shabbir ka jab kunba nana&nbsp; ke shahar pohncha<br>farhan aur safdar ye zainab ne kaha sughra<br>barbaad huwa ghar ay sughra<br>huwa qatl baraadar ay sughra<br>abbas aur akbar ay sughra<br>koyi nahin sar par ay sughra<br>is waaste bhaayi ne bola tha tujhe beta<br>le jaawun tujhe kaise</big></p>
